  "remarks": "Vladlen Shorin is the General Director of Joint Stock Company (JSC) RT-Techpriemka, a Russian military industry company. The company, under an agreement with the Russian Ministry of Defence, provides certification services for components dedicated to military industry companies. In addition, JSC RT-Techpriemka produces metal alloys (such as VNS9-Sh type) for companies that produce Mi-26, Mi-28 and Ka-52 helicopters. Mi-26, Mi-28 and Ka-52 helicopters are used by the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine.",
